ading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"e57e4679-ac9f-4f0a-bf2b-fbe7fd00b479"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：列出当前前端授权范围内可用的技能能力\n</hidden_step>\n<hidden_step source=\"skill_router\" title=\"SkillRouter 路由\">\n路由原因：No intent scene for scene skill filter\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"74dfd0e3-d16e-4666-808c-25b0ebeafcc5"},{"content":"我先对上传的视频进行实际检测，了解数据中的真实情况，再逐一回答你的四个需求。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":203,"prompt_tokens":10627,"total_tokens":10830,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":95,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":203},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":10627}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-0ce29547-15fc-9102-a913-8fa5b94fb3e6","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9de0-9030-70f1-88c8-dbadcba67f56-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4","capture_seconds":5,"labels":"person,car,truck,bus"},"id":"call_8ef1e017663d44d7a1d15f96","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":10627,"output_tokens":203,"total_toke